      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 9,
          "section": "4.1. The origin of deformation bands",
          "quote": "At 800 /C14 C, a region with serrated structures consisting of several parallel lathes were observed ( Fig. 10a), and each lath had a length of hundreds of nm and a width of tens of nm. The <1 21 3 > SAED pattern indicated that the lathes are a hex- agonal close-packed (HCP)-structured phase (a ¼ 310.6 p.m., c ¼ 474.4 p.m.), in which there are twins with {1 1 01} twinning",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "Fig. 10",
          "chunk_id": "f523f839d0e8433a:part:001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
